        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Explainer Clip from a Paragraph\n\nTurns a paragraph into a short narrated video. An agent writes the shot description from the same text, so the picture matches the narration.\n\n**How it works:** \"Topic\" goes to two places. \"Shot description\" turns it into one literal, filmable sentence, which \"Footage\" renders as a six-second 16:9 clip. \"Narration\" reads the original text aloud. \"Combine\" lays the narration over the footage, and \"Clip\" shows the result. Pick a model on each of the three generation nodes.\n\n**Try this:** Write a two-sentence explanation in \"Topic\", such as how a lock works, and raise the \"Footage\" duration if the narration runs long."
        },
